This product bundles third-party data and assets under their own terms:

- Map data, classic routes and road files derived from OpenStreetMap,
  © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database License
  (ODbL 1.0): https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
  These data files are not covered by the Apache License.
- Offline atlas and US state outlines from Natural Earth (public domain).
- Ground, asphalt and gravel textures from Poly Haven (CC0, public domain).
- Low-poly 3D models (cars, zombie, trees, plants, rocks, buildings)
  by Quaternius, https://quaternius.com (CC0, public domain).
- Detailed 3D models in public/models/hd/ generated for this game from its own
  concept pictures (made with FLUX.1 schnell, Apache 2.0): vehicles, bosses,
  enemies and animals with Tripo image-to-3D (https://www.tripo3d.ai); buildings,
  houses and landmarks with Microsoft TRELLIS.2 (MIT) in ComfyUI. Shrunk with
  glTF Transform (MIT).
- Bump maps ground_n.jpg and asphalt_n.jpg made from the Poly Haven textures.
- Live weather from Open-Meteo.com (CC BY 4.0), fetched at play time.

